docs/DECISIONS.md:2964:  6. **Small matters opened as questions** (H6, "A， A"): a question opens only when its scale can change the company's revenue, profit, cash or credit risk; otherwise the statement is evidence. Done in this round together with the merge changes, each measured as its own arm, then together on the holdout. Narrows the standard §3 class C ("a sized, not yet completed stake or acquisition").
