   290	### 7.3 Iterating
   291	
   292	- **Settle the ruler before iterating.** When the gold and the standard disagree, two standards conflict, or readers
   293	  disagree about what is right, stop the arms and settle the ruler with Alex (D241: "你停下手边的工作先把我这个事情完整深度的给做好").
   294	- **One class at a time** (Alex, 2026-10-29: "你一类一类改，快速迭代然后测regression"). Count the misses by mechanism;
   295	  take the largest class; trace it to the sentence that causes it; change one thing aimed at that class; run the whole
   296	  bench (a prompt change alters every request, so every article is an affected call) against the previous version;
   297	  read every regression to its raw answer. The pages that
   298	  showed the failure locate its mechanism; only the whole bench (every set, every draw) accepts the change. An arm
   299	  that changes three sentences cannot say which one worked and which one hurt.
   300	- **A model call is a sampler.** Re-send a stored request before calling its answer a defect. Totals and acceptance come
   301	  from at least three samples beside a fresh control; a bar the control fails against itself judges nothing. A
   302	  direct-read pass (one send per article, every answer read beside its source; D238) locates mechanisms; its counts
   303	  are one draw and are labelled so.
   304	- **A written log.** One row per arm: hypothesis, change, numbers against the control (regressions first), kept or not.
   305	  Refuted arms and your own mistakes stay in it; the next session starts from its last row.
   306	- **Own the loop.** When the direction is agreed and no stop is in force (`CURRENT_STATE.md`), push your own hypotheses and run the cheapest next arm without
   307	  asking; bring Alex only the choices that change what the system does.
   308	- **Small first, then one run.** A day or week slice before any whole-corpus run; preflight on stored data before any
   309	  paid run (§5); no edit while a run is live (§9). A paid run measures a configuration; it never tries a fix.
   310	  Before each send, write what it can still change in the decision and which risk the cheaper check left uncovered; a
   311	  replicate or control that only re-measures noise or a settled comparison is not sent, and a fix is not sent before the
   312	  model's own account and the request locate where the decision is made (2026-10-30, after two fixes guessed at the
   313	  evidence rule took four full runs and a one-sentence fix was given two more: "你跑这么多次真的有意义吗"; "我感觉你在为了跑而跑").
   314	- **A failed arm is diagnosed before the next one.** When an arm fixes its class and regresses another, write the root cause
   315	  first: the process error (what grew, what the small sample did not guard) and the mechanism, traced to the raw answers and
   316	  the model's account, never a guess stated as the cause. A small sample guards every class the change can move, not only
   317	  its own. When a fix keeps moving another class, the call is doing several jobs: move the rule to its owner (a field's
   318	  definition sits in the schema beside the field) rather than add a sentence (Alex, 2026-10-30: "那你这些修改都是失败的呀，为什么，
